{"unit_id":"accpowered__dsh-auto-review#card-zh","repo":"accpowered/dsh-auto-review","commit":"fbc62abdad0ca49658c44c8e0e0cc9fc3a2e7771","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-review 是面向 DSH 的审批处理插件，接入 approval/request 流程，在自动审批策略下处理沙箱权限升级请求。它先规范化命令并应用可配置规则，再将需要进一步判断的请求交给指定的 LLM，返回允许、拒绝或转交人工的结果。插件还支持把用户提示作为复核上下文、记录每次决定，并通过设置项调整模型路由和规则。适合希望在 DSH 会话中配置自动审批流程的用户。使用前需要带有项目所需补丁的 Harness 核心，并配置 reviewer provider 与 model。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:792-887","src/index.ts:391-434","src/index.ts:540-584","cordis.patch.yml:42-47"]}
{"unit_id":"accpowered__dsh-auto-review#card-en","repo":"accpowered/dsh-auto-review","commit":"fbc62abdad0ca49658c44c8e0e0cc9fc3a2e7771","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-auto-review handles DSH sandbox approval requests. It normalizes commands, applies rules, and sends unresolved requests to a selected LLM. It can attach session prompts for a second review, record decisions, and expose live settings. A patched Harness core and reviewer route are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:792-887","src/index.ts:391-434","src/index.ts:540-584","cordis.patch.yml:42-47"]}
