{"unit_id":"accpowered__dsh-auto-review#feature-1","repo":"accpowered/dsh-auto-review","commit":"fbc62abdad0ca49658c44c8e0e0cc9fc3a2e7771","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-review 的功能「规则筛选」：审批请求到达时，插件规范化命令并应用配置的匹配规则；符合规则的请求直接返回处理结果，其余进入后续复核。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:391-405","src/index.ts:819-830"]}
{"unit_id":"accpowered__dsh-auto-review#feature-2","repo":"accpowered/dsh-auto-review","commit":"fbc62abdad0ca49658c44c8e0e0cc9fc3a2e7771","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-review 的功能「模型复核」：未由规则直接处理的请求会发送到配置的 provider/model，模型输出允许、拒绝或不确定的单词式结果；不确定时可转交后续审批处理器。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:540-584","src/index.ts:833-848"]}
{"unit_id":"accpowered__dsh-auto-review#feature-3","repo":"accpowered/dsh-auto-review","commit":"fbc62abdad0ca49658c44c8e0e0cc9fc3a2e7771","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-review 的功能「提示上下文复核」：首次模型复核返回拒绝且启用提示上下文时，插件可提取会话中的用户提示再发起一次复核，最终结果用于处理该请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:627-647","src/index.ts:849-879"]}
